cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this book or the tool, please cite it as below."
title: "From Field to Code: PyQGIS from Scratch"
abstract: >-
  An open book and a QGIS 4 tool that show which residential buildings stand
  close to overhead power lines and how long fire crews take to reach them,
  by day and by night. Worked example: Lena, Asturias (Spain).
type: software
authors:
